  t("<b>Akshay Kumar Dutt</b> (1820-1866 handout; slide title 1820-1886)", "Brahmo Samajist; <b>medical opinion against child marriage</b> (science, not scripture: pure social reformer like Derozians)", "Advocated courtship before marriage, equality + partnership in marriage, <b>right to divorce</b> by law and custom", w=24),
